Archive content:
	WWBBSShell-Help    -> an help file for the user.
	WWBBSShell-Startup -> shell startup.
	WWBBSShell-Stop    -> call when exiting the wwbbsshell.

   This is JUST A IDEA of startup script for WWBBSshell.
It make WWBBSshell work with multiuser in a very simple way,
              (if you don't use  multiuser, remove "logout")
and limit the current nomber of wwbbsshell users.

To try this, put the 3 files in WWBBS:s,
and make a new entry in the menu preference :
     access range : <what you want>
     character    : <what you want>
      ...
      ...
      ...
     command      : DOSCOMMAND WWBBSshell from WWBBS:S/WWBBSshell-startup
